            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Your Google sign-in is kept in the Keychain.</strong> Chora used to store it alongside its other settings. It moves over on its own the first time this version opens, so you stay signed in.</li>
<li><strong>Chora only connects over secure links</strong>, except to your Mac itself and to Spotify&#x27;s album art, which Spotify still sends without one.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
